+1 for the proposal. In terms of the format, the current solution is simple
enough. But I propose to use a trimmed openAPI's format directly. It won't
add much cost as we can just take the minimum fields we want. But it opens
a window to extend it in the future. For example, it is easier if we want
to include operationID, or adding feature flags, or adding parameters. Here
is an example:

{

  "resources": [

    {

      "/v1/{prefix}/namespaces":

        {

          "GET": {

          "description": "List all namespaces"

          }

        },

        {

          "POST": {

          "description": "Create a new namespace"

          }

        }

    },

    {

      "path2": {}

    }

  ...

  ]

}

Yufei

